From faf5600d3c06c4759c6dbaadbe7ef355b1d15412 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cyrene963 <Nitrogen@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 15 May 2026 00:34:17 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix: apply 6 high-value upstream patches (P0/P1/P2 security +
 stability)

P0 Security:
- os.chmod bricks host: add _secure_dir_safe() helper to 5 call sites
  (tools/mcp_oauth.py, hermes_cli/auth.py x3, agent/google_oauth.py)
  Prevents chmod / to 0o700 when path.parent resolves to root

P1 Fixes:
- Telegram REQUIRES_EDIT_FINALIZE (#25724): ensure final MarkdownV2 edit
  is not skipped when raw text is unchanged
- Cron honor disabled_toolsets (#25815): intersect per-job enabled_toolsets
  with platform toolsets to prevent LLM bypassing agent.disabled_toolsets

P2 Fixes:
- delegate_task status misclassification (#25825): 'completed or summary'
  instead of just 'summary' for correct status
- context_length=0 guard (#25812): reject non-positive values in cache
- streaming per turn reset (#25771): re-enable streaming each turn instead
  of permanent session disable

Applied from upstream open PRs: #25724, #25815, #25825, #25812, #25771
P0 fix from issue #25821 (no upstream PR yet)
